1
00:00:01,020 --> 00:00:05,520
Finally, the champion Nankatsu managed to equalize in the second half.

2
00:00:06,100 --> 00:00:09,960
Thanks to defender Takasugi, they managed to score a very important goal.

3
00:00:09,960 --> 00:00:12,530
Can Nankatsu keep this up and win the match?

4
00:00:12,530 --> 00:00:18,530
On the other hand, the rookie Azumaichi MS is putting on a good performance despite the score being tied.

5
00:00:18,530 --> 00:00:21,470
Can they equalize and take it to penalties?

6
00:00:21,470 --> 00:00:22,500
Fools.

7
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:24,010
A draw is out of the question.

8
00:00:24,010 --> 00:00:25,790
We will win!

9
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:29,130
Only 10 minutes left until the end of the second half.

10
00:00:29,640 --> 00:00:34,180
The fate of the match will be decided by one last goal!

11
00:00:36,180 --> 00:00:39,010
Soda won't let it end like this.

